Hello....

I´d like to download packages dynamically inside a Renjin script.  I´m not using Maven nor Renjin REPL.  It´s just a normal java application that binds to Renjin jar-with-dependencies.  From a previous post I understand that the functionality to download a library dynamically exists, at least for the REPL version of Renjin.  Does it also exist for the jar-with-dependencies?  If not, could this be added to this jar?  If not, could you point me to the code in the REPL version so that I can integrate it with my application?

Thanks

Rodrigo

