We recently added https support to nexus.bedatadriven.com <http://nexus.bedatadriven.com>, and it looks like sbt is refusing to follow the 301 redirect from the http:// url.

I tried updating your build.sbt with the following:

resolvers +=
  "BeDataDriven" at "https://nexus.bedatadriven.com/content/groups/public/ <http://nexus.bedatadriven.com/content/groups/public/>"

