  settings(
    name := "renjin-test",
    version := "1.0",
    scalaVersion := "2.10.6",

    libraryDependencies += "org.renjin" % "renjin-script-engine" % "0.8.1886"
  )

And was able to run sbt compile successfully.

Does this work for you?

Alex

