Alex,

Now all dependencies seem to be correct. However, I´m getting errors when trying to load a library. As you suggested, Ive changed my old code:
factory = Java::JavaxScript.ScriptEngineManager.new <http://JavaxScript.ScriptEngineManager.new>()
@engine = factory.getEngineByName("Renjin")

to the new code:
session = SessionBuilder.new
          .bind(PackageLoader.java_class, AetherPackageLoader.new).build
@engine = RenjinScriptEngineFactory.new.getScriptEngine(session);

This is mostly working fine for evaluating an R script (next post will show a bug). However, doing:
R.eval("library('AssetPricing')")

