This is not currently something that can changed: AetherPackageFactory is hardcoded to use Maven's default directory at ~/.m2/repository for the sake of compatibility.

The AetherPackageLoader could be parametrized to accept an alternative directory. If you open an issue on Github I'll try to take a look at this week.

